Why you may still see two headers
Most likely: the parent page has a header, and your iframe content is not actually hitting this report.php path/runtime with iframe present (rewrite/proxy/alternate app path issue), or a custom override template is reintroducing header chrome.

report.php uses customTemplate(...), so an override could exist in:

templates/custom_override/main_iframe.tpl
templates/custom_override/main.tpl
and change behavior.

Minimal change (if behavior truly missing in your deployed path)
If you want this to be explicit and future-proof, the smallest safe tweak is to compute a boolean once and assign it into Smarty, then gate header include in main.tpl (or keep current branch logic + boolean for clarity).

