Security/framing caveat to check before changes
I did not see an obvious per-route frame-block in the snippets returned, but you should verify response headers for:

X-Frame-Options
Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors ...
If those are restrictive globally, iframe embedding may be intentionally constrained (or only allowed same-origin). Your current behavior suggests framing is allowed, but double-check app/web-server headers before broadening embedded support.
